# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Local env / editor noise
.DS_Store
*.log
.idea/
.vscode/

# Packed bundles (produced by `pnpm pack`)
*.tgz

# NOTE: `lib/` is deliberately NOT ignored.
#
# It is the compiled output, and it is committed on purpose: dsh installs a
# plugin from git as *source*, and a build would require a `prepare` script that
# the user must explicitly authorise — which means letting this package run code
# on their machine at install time. Shipping the build output removes that
# requirement entirely.
#
# Consequence for contributors: run `npm run build` and commit `lib/` together
# with `src/`, or the published behaviour will not match the source.
